(5009316, 730874, 14437, '<td valign="top">You got so many things in this image that made it a top scorer. The composition is great and I like the way you crop. <br/>The child expression alone will score you another point or two. And the lighting, wow, I just have to give you a 10 for this one. Well done!</td>', 'You got so many things in this image that made it a top scorer. The composition is great and I like the way you crop. The child expression alone will score you another point or two. And the lighting, wow, I just have to give you a 10 for this one. Well done!', '2008-10-15 09:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009320, 730470, 14437, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection. There were many color reflection images in this challenge and your B&amp;W version created something really different.<br/>This is so different from a normal scenery composition. I could see a story within this image. I like the feel of dynamic from the child riding the bicycle, and a static feel from the couple. The only nit is the contrast on the water which I think could be better through post process, but then I understand that you are much limited by the Basic Editing restrictions. So I''ll give you a "9". Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful reflection. There were many color reflection images in this challenge and your B&W version created something really different.This is so different from a normal scenery composition. I could see a story within this image. I like the feel of dynamic from the child riding the bicycle, and a static feel from the couple. The only nit is the contrast on the water which I think could be better through post process, but then I understand that you are much limited by the Basic Editing restrictions. So I''ll give you a "9". Well done!', '2008-10-15 09:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009325, 730453, 14437, '<td valign="top">I''m a macro fan and this is the only macro shot that''s so well composed. I really like the color, green matches very well against yellow. The only nit is some visible noise on body area. You got a "9" for this image. Well done!</td>', 'I''m a macro fan and this is the only macro shot that''s so well composed. I really like the color, green matches very well against yellow. The only nit is some visible noise on body area. You got a "9" for this image. Well done!', '2008-10-15 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009328, 731063, 14437, '<td valign="top">You really have a sense of humor. This is very original. Well done! You got a "9".</td>', 'You really have a sense of humor. This is very original. Well done! You got a "9".', '2008-10-15 09:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
