(5010939, 731152, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but obviously high ISO to catch that smoke. If this were advanced, I would suggest some selective NR on the smoke. Pretty neat looking and I like the lighting. I assume the glass must be upside down and the image also flipped. If that''s the case, you have doomed yourself to DNMC votes by over-meeting the challenge. (Didn''t think that could be done until now!)Good luck, this was clearly some work and deserves a decent score.</td>', 'A little grainy, but obviously high ISO to catch that smoke. If this were advanced, I would suggest some selective NR on the smoke. Pretty neat looking and I like the lighting. I assume the glass must be upside down and the image also flipped. If that''s the case, you have doomed yourself to DNMC votes by over-meeting the challenge. (Didn''t think that could be done until now!)Good luck, this was clearly some work and deserves a decent score.', '2008-10-16 00:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
