(5010955, 730413, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reflection in a lake? Abstracts tend to not do well in challenges, but maybe this is a topic that is friendlier to them. As for myself, I really like this. I find the colors and shapes very engaging and interesting. It plays with my eyes. A fave and a high vote.</td>', 'Reflection in a lake? Abstracts tend to not do well in challenges, but maybe this is a topic that is friendlier to them. As for myself, I really like this. I find the colors and shapes very engaging and interesting. It plays with my eyes. A fave and a high vote.', '2008-10-16 01:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
