(5013624, 730956, 86447, '<td valign="top">One of my top ten picks.   Lovely.  I like the mutedness of it all and teh composition.</td>', 'One of my top ten picks.   Lovely.  I like the mutedness of it all and teh composition.', '2008-10-18 14:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
