(5014073, 731146, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of the glasses and the lighting on them. The cloth holding these glasses to the clothespins is pretty dark and I could not figure out what they were at first. Once I figured that out, it was evident that either the shot was rotated, or gravity does not work quit right in your area.</td>', 'I like the tone of the glasses and the lighting on them. The cloth holding these glasses to the clothespins is pretty dark and I could not figure out what they were at first. Once I figured that out, it was evident that either the shot was rotated, or gravity does not work quit right in your area.', '2008-10-19 01:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
