(5014081, 730815, 83313, '<td valign="top">A creative effort, and one you clearly put some thought and effort into. I''m afraid it''s not coming off well to me, however. The image as a whole strikes me as too dark, so the very important element of the reflection is not jumping out with a quick glance (and a quick glance is all that most entries get from the average voter here). I think it''s also cropped extremely tight and could benefit from a little more breathing room.</td>', 'A creative effort, and one you clearly put some thought and effort into. I''m afraid it''s not coming off well to me, however. The image as a whole strikes me as too dark, so the very important element of the reflection is not jumping out with a quick glance (and a quick glance is all that most entries get from the average voter here). I think it''s also cropped extremely tight and could benefit from a little more breathing room.', '2008-10-19 01:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
