(5014324, 730045, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro, with the blanked out background it''s hard to determine if this was actually upside down or not, but looking at it''s feet it looks like it probably was.<br/> <br/>Lovely focus on the main eye, the crop might be a little tight at the bottom though.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Nice Macro, with the blanked out background it''s hard to determine if this was actually upside down or not, but looking at it''s feet it looks like it probably was. Lovely focus on the main eye, the crop might be a little tight at the bottom though. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014329, 730977, 96721, '<td valign="top">Yep soft and lacking contrast Liz :( Looked so much better when you first edited it.<br/> <br/>Sorry I should have checked on my monitor or calibrated yours before you entered it.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Yep soft and lacking contrast Liz :( Looked so much better when you first edited it. Sorry I should have checked on my monitor or calibrated yours before you entered it. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014331, 731099, 96721, '<td valign="top">Best of the two images of this type, wonderful colours and at a stretch meets the challenge ;)<br/> <br/>Nice focus and really nice with the square crop<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Best of the two images of this type, wonderful colours and at a stretch meets the challenge ;) Nice focus and really nice with the square crop Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014332, 730821, 96721, '<td valign="top">It''s a real shame the light isn''t dappled over his face / lower eye as this could have been a cracking shot. As it is it doesn''t hold my attention long enough as I want to focus on the lower eye but there is nothing there to look at but shadow. Looks a little over saturated as well.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'It''s a real shame the light isn''t dappled over his face / lower eye as this could have been a cracking shot. As it is it doesn''t hold my attention long enough as I want to focus on the lower eye but there is nothing there to look at but shadow. Looks a little over saturated as well. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014333, 730815, 96721, '<td valign="top">Crops a little tight all round, would also have liked to see a bit more of the reflection, I get that the pepsi can is upside down but it would have had more impact with the coke cans being upside down strongly in the reflection too. Maybe some water drops on the cans would have also added some interest - you know how DPC loves its water so much ;)<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Crops a little tight all round, would also have liked to see a bit more of the reflection, I get that the pepsi can is upside down but it would have had more impact with the coke cans being upside down strongly in the reflection too. Maybe some water drops on the cans would have also added some interest - you know how DPC loves its water so much ;) Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014334, 729917, 96721, '<td valign="top">Haha nice take on the challenge, a true upside down shot - a bit of a rarity in itself ;)<br/> <br/>Nice conversion, hope the little fella didn''t have to stay upside down too long for you to grab this great shot.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Haha nice take on the challenge, a true upside down shot - a bit of a rarity in itself ;) Nice conversion, hope the little fella didn''t have to stay upside down too long for you to grab this great shot. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014336, 729637, 96721, '<td valign="top">Looks a little soft and colours seem a little off this could be due to the harsh light I guess - but I think your score will suffer for it.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Looks a little soft and colours seem a little off this could be due to the harsh light I guess - but I think your score will suffer for it. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014337, 731069, 96721, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, nicely cropped / composed - lovely PP and love how the stars are not reflected making for two almost completely seperate scenes.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Awesome shot, nicely cropped / composed - lovely PP and love how the stars are not reflected making for two almost completely seperate scenes. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014338, 730333, 96721, '<td valign="top">Too small, OOF, bit too fussy will be in real contention for the brown I think :(<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Too small, OOF, bit too fussy will be in real contention for the brown I think :( Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014340, 730877, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic shot, didn''t see this one on my first scan through. Decided to comment on all images as there were some people asking for comments in the forums, so glad I did or I might have missed this wonderful shot.<br/> <br/>Nothing I can say to give CC a really nice image as it is.<br/> <br/>Actually I will say that the grass at the top might be a bit of a distraction and I would love to see how a square crop on this would have looked.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Nice dramatic shot, didn''t see this one on my first scan through. Decided to comment on all images as there were some people asking for comments in the forums, so glad I did or I might have missed this wonderful shot. Nothing I can say to give CC a really nice image as it is. Actually I will say that the grass at the top might be a bit of a distraction and I would love to see how a square crop on this would have looked. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014344, 730700, 96721, '<td valign="top">Most purely rotated / flipped images would have been an immediate DNMC vote from me, however this one actually works as I think it is more interesting upside down than up the right way, also it has you looking in to the image more than it would otherwise.<br/> <br/>Nice composition and I think I would have voted 7 on this<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Most purely rotated / flipped images would have been an immediate DNMC vote from me, however this one actually works as I think it is more interesting upside down than up the right way, also it has you looking in to the image more than it would otherwise. Nice composition and I think I would have voted 7 on this Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014347, 731058, 96721, '<td valign="top">My immediate thought was "NOT ANOTHER DAMN ROTATED IMAGE!!" but fortunately I like to look at images to see if I am missing something and I so obviously was after a few moments of adjusting (which I wouldn''t be surprised to see you slated in the votes for due to the 2second voters).<br/> <br/>Love the lines, love the clarity in the reflection raelly, really nice image, would have been in my top 5 easy and probably an 8 or 9 just for the thought in the way the image was shot.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'My immediate thought was "NOT ANOTHER DAMN ROTATED IMAGE!!" but fortunately I like to look at images to see if I am missing something and I so obviously was after a few moments of adjusting (which I wouldn''t be surprised to see you slated in the votes for due to the 2second voters). Love the lines, love the clarity in the reflection raelly, really nice image, would have been in my top 5 easy and probably an 8 or 9 just for the thought in the way the image was shot. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014348, 731035, 96721, '<td valign="top">Lacks a little contrast and colour for my liking, nice shot though and I like the falling leaves.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Lacks a little contrast and colour for my liking, nice shot though and I like the falling leaves. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014349, 730981, 96721, '<td valign="top">Go Lori, Go Team UK :)<br/> <br/>Love the colours and the interaction between the horses really adds to this shot for me.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Go Lori, Go Team UK :) Love the colours and the interaction between the horses really adds to this shot for me. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014350, 730318, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, wonderful colours, maybe a little tightly cropped at the bottom but I get the feeling you wanted to cut the image in half which does work also.<br/> <br/>Something bugs me ever so slightly though, not sure if it needs straightening and also a little sharpening.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Nice shot, wonderful colours, maybe a little tightly cropped at the bottom but I get the feeling you wanted to cut the image in half which does work also. Something bugs me ever so slightly though, not sure if it needs straightening and also a little sharpening. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014351, 730397, 96721, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, cool sunset, I like both of the shots that are similar in this respect. But I guess this is a little more finished in the PP department, I really like that this is crisp as it fits here.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Cool shot, cool sunset, I like both of the shots that are similar in this respect. But I guess this is a little more finished in the PP department, I really like that this is crisp as it fits here. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014353, 731100, 96721, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a much tighter crop with half the large bolder being cropped out and on the right a tight crop to that bolder which would have bought the human element much more to the forefront which I think would have added a lot more interest to this image, those are some wonderful tones around the people and as a square or portrait layout with the crop mentioned above could have made for a really interesting shot IMHO.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'I would have liked to see a much tighter crop with half the large bolder being cropped out and on the right a tight crop to that bolder which would have bought the human element much more to the forefront which I think would have added a lot more interest to this image, those are some wonderful tones around the people and as a square or portrait layout with the crop mentioned above could have made for a really interesting shot IMHO. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014355, 730475, 96721, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately poor lighting, a little soft and no wow factor I think this will place really poorly :(<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Unfortunately poor lighting, a little soft and no wow factor I think this will place really poorly :( Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014358, 730293, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and the sort of DOF I personally really like (I know some people like the whole "subject" to be in focus but I like this sort of shallow DOF in my macros as I feel it adds interest.<br/> <br/>Not sure how it will score though, spiders are not the most voter friendly subject.<br/> <br/>Comment Only</td>', 'Nice macro and the sort of DOF I personally really like (I know some people like the whole "subject" to be in focus but I like this sort of shallow DOF in my macros as I feel it adds interest. Not sure how it will score though, spiders are not the most voter friendly subject. Comment Only', '2008-10-19 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014360, 730356, 86447, '<td valign="top">The ''bar'' of darkness in the middle of the two reflections is genius.  LOVELY composition.  I hope this is doing well for you.</td>', 'The ''bar'' of darkness in the middle of the two reflections is genius.  LOVELY composition.  I hope this is doing well for you.', '2008-10-19 10:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014363, 730982, 86447, '<td valign="top">One of my top three picks.   The composition and colors are beautiful.  I wish those two little stalks had been plucked before the photo was taken.  Would make this a ten instead of a nine.   <br/> <br/>I get lost in this image...  Beautiful.   <br/> <br/>P.S. Looks like a bit of lens dust right near the center left...</td>', 'One of my top three picks.   The composition and colors are beautiful.  I wish those two little stalks had been plucked before the photo was taken.  Would make this a ten instead of a nine.    I get lost in this image...  Beautiful.    P.S. Looks like a bit of lens dust right near the center left...', '2008-10-19 10:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014364, 730926, 86447, '<td valign="top">Bumping this one up a notch.   I really like your composition and the colors.  That blue is fabulous!</td>', 'Bumping this one up a notch.   I really like your composition and the colors.  That blue is fabulous!', '2008-10-19 10:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014367, 730470, 86447, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.   The ''lifeness'' of it all really talks to me here.<br/> <br/>The wall of names representing death, the old folks in mourning or respect and the youth speeding by obliviously.   It''s a perfect scene to represent life and its phases.  I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.   The ''lifeness'' of it all really talks to me here. The wall of names representing death, the old folks in mourning or respect and the youth speeding by obliviously.   It''s a perfect scene to represent life and its phases.  I hope this does well for you.', '2008-10-19 10:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
