(5018875, 729543, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the colour and tone, I find full-colour boat shots often look cluttered and busy.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the colour and tone, I find full-colour boat shots often look cluttered and busy.', '2008-10-21 20:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5018878, 729637, 94265, '<td valign="top">I was expecting to see a lot more of these shots. This is really good, composition is sound and while the background is really bright, her face doesn''t appear washed-out. Reminds me of being afraid to go over the monkey bars bridge when I was her age!</td>', 'I was expecting to see a lot more of these shots. This is really good, composition is sound and while the background is really bright, her face doesn''t appear washed-out. Reminds me of being afraid to go over the monkey bars bridge when I was her age!', '2008-10-21 20:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
