(5019473, 730016, 53964, '<td valign="top">I LIKE this. A lot! I like the facelessness, I like the lack of point of reference (such as the ground), I like the blur and lighting. Very surreal. It''s what my dreams look like.  <br/> <br/>Personally, I MIGHT have cropped just a touch of tree so the dark wasn''t quite so heavy, because it tends to draw my eye a bit, but that''s the only change I''d make.</td>', 'I LIKE this. A lot! I like the facelessness, I like the lack of point of reference (such as the ground), I like the blur and lighting. Very surreal. It''s what my dreams look like.   Personally, I MIGHT have cropped just a touch of tree so the dark wasn''t quite so heavy, because it tends to draw my eye a bit, but that''s the only change I''d make.', '2008-10-22 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
