(5019700, 731122, 16106, '<td valign="top">Man, what are the odds? I was shooting from the point of the yacht harbor jetty, so you were all the way across the harbor and the green? Ah the joy of the long glass, it looks like we were standing shoulder to shoulder.<br/> <br/>I may be prejudiced, but how does this get nine ones? I think its brilliant;)</td>', 'Man, what are the odds? I was shooting from the point of the yacht harbor jetty, so you were all the way across the harbor and the green? Ah the joy of the long glass, it looks like we were standing shoulder to shoulder. I may be prejudiced, but how does this get nine ones? I think its brilliant;)', '2008-10-22 03:24:22.000000', NULL, 0),
