(5020009, 731058, 91527, '<td valign="top">I think this image suffered from "I don''t understand!! :(" type votes more than it did from any technical flaw.  Pity -- I really liked it.</td>', 'I think this image suffered from "I don''t understand!! :(" type votes more than it did from any technical flaw.  Pity -- I really liked it.', '2008-10-22 08:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
