(5020190, 731152, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like I was right about this one. You can join Judi in the list of people who hurt their score by meeting the challenge too well.<br/> <br/>A very underrated shot. This challenge had a lot of those.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-23 20:06:41.</i></td>', 'Looks like I was right about this one. You can join Judi in the list of people who hurt their score by meeting the challenge too well. A very underrated shot. This challenge had a lot of those.', '2008-10-22 10:24:10.000000', '2008-10-23 21:06:41.000000', 0),
(5020195, 731058, 61315, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but if I had, I probably would have given it a 6. The image is nice and sharp, and the colors and composition are nice. This was quite an illusion and your success at capturing it lead to confusion as I''m sure most voters couldn''t tell this was a reflection and thought "DMNC" when viewing it. I''m finding out that you have to hit the majority of the voters over the head with an image that very obviously fits the challenge so my only advice would be to be have a very literal take on the challenge description. I know I will next time, if I continue to beat my head against the DPC wall! I only received a 4.5648 on my "Inside Out" picture, so only my second worst score - I can''t even win a "worst score" challenge!  :-D Good luck in future challenges!</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but if I had, I probably would have given it a 6. The image is nice and sharp, and the colors and composition are nice. This was quite an illusion and your success at capturing it lead to confusion as I''m sure most voters couldn''t tell this was a reflection and thought "DMNC" when viewing it. I''m finding out that you have to hit the majority of the voters over the head with an image that very obviously fits the challenge so my only advice would be to be have a very literal take on the challenge description. I know I will next time, if I continue to beat my head against the DPC wall! I only received a 4.5648 on my "Inside Out" picture, so only my second worst score - I can''t even win a "worst score" challenge!  :-D Good luck in future challenges!', '2008-10-22 10:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020199, 730356, 46778, '<td valign="top">Great work, I''m glad that your effort paid off. Congrats. You had this challenge figured out from the beginning. Dido Julie on the scoring.</td>', 'Great work, I''m glad that your effort paid off. Congrats. You had this challenge figured out from the beginning. Dido Julie on the scoring.', '2008-10-22 10:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020202, 731142, 32145, '<td valign="top">hi all. thanks for the comments. very helpful. the problem i''m having is saving down to meet the requirements for the image submittal. the original is very sharp in focus, but when i saved it down, it lost sharpness and lost most of it''s color...the original is so brilliant, it made my heart sink a little when i saw the submitted image on screen...anyway, it''d be great to hear any thoughts on how to save an image down to size, as i''m quite new at this. or if someone can point me in the right direction. I think this image could''ve finished up a little higher if i''d been able to correct these things.<br/> <br/>thanks!</td>', 'hi all. thanks for the comments. very helpful. the problem i''m having is saving down to meet the requirements for the image submittal. the original is very sharp in focus, but when i saved it down, it lost sharpness and lost most of it''s color...the original is so brilliant, it made my heart sink a little when i saw the submitted image on screen...anyway, it''d be great to hear any thoughts on how to save an image down to size, as i''m quite new at this. or if someone can point me in the right direction. I think this image could''ve finished up a little higher if i''d been able to correct these things. thanks!', '2008-10-22 10:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020203, 731063, 61961, '<td valign="top">Incredibly well done, and your two expressions mirror each other so well.  Of course I recognize you by now, but had I voted in this challenge I wouldn''t have marked you down for it. :-)</td>', 'Incredibly well done, and your two expressions mirror each other so well.  Of course I recognize you by now, but had I voted in this challenge I wouldn''t have marked you down for it. :-)', '2008-10-22 10:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
