(5020209, 731063, 20577, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments. I was amazed to see how my score really shot up once this was verified. <br/> <br/>With this shot I pretty much just stood in the same place (maybe a half step over) and simply flipped my camera over and fired off the flash. It was much easier than I thought it was going to be. If I could go back and do it again I would have worn something different. I think if I would have dressed up a little more the score would have been better. I probably could have also used my wife in one of the shots and that would have worked as well. Anyway, I liked how it turned out and I wish voters would vote based on what they see, not whether or not they think I cheated.</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments. I was amazed to see how my score really shot up once this was verified.  With this shot I pretty much just stood in the same place (maybe a half step over) and simply flipped my camera over and fired off the flash. It was much easier than I thought it was going to be. If I could go back and do it again I would have worn something different. I think if I would have dressed up a little more the score would have been better. I probably could have also used my wife in one of the shots and that would have worked as well. Anyway, I liked how it turned out and I wish voters would vote based on what they see, not whether or not they think I cheated.', '2008-10-22 10:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
