(5020830, 730293, 67145, '<td valign="top">shame you got such a low score for such an excellent macro .. <br/>you really take a risk entering insect, spider and creepy crawly shots in a challenge .. some of the best images can bomb out .. some ppl just arent into them and vote accordingly .. <br/>i love the nearly metallic looking background, so soft and delicate that highlights your spider so well .. love the wispy web surrounding him .. its a great shot .. :)</td>', 'shame you got such a low score for such an excellent macro .. you really take a risk entering insect, spider and creepy crawly shots in a challenge .. some of the best images can bomb out .. some ppl just arent into them and vote accordingly .. i love the nearly metallic looking background, so soft and delicate that highlights your spider so well .. love the wispy web surrounding him .. its a great shot .. :)', '2008-10-22 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
