(5023932, 730970, 76598, '<td valign="top">I gave your image a 5.  The image struck me as being very busy, the background is a little too bright relative to the butterfly and though it probably has very sharp focus on the eye, the large f stop gave you a shallow depth of field that caused you to loose focus on the wings and the body.  And, the wings appear a bit washed out....I would too if I were dead</td>', 'I gave your image a 5.  The image struck me as being very busy, the background is a little too bright relative to the butterfly and though it probably has very sharp focus on the eye, the large f stop gave you a shallow depth of field that caused you to loose focus on the wings and the body.  And, the wings appear a bit washed out....I would too if I were dead', '2008-10-24 20:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
