(5163145, 731058, 76430, '<td valign="top">I sympathize with you.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but if I had seen this I would have thought it was right-side up with a lawn on bottom, shaded wall and building even after looking at it for a while.  It was just too perfect with no leaves or ripples in the water.  Of course it''s really obvious when you see the original unrotated image.  If we had seen some more orientation detail "below" the lawn or if there were some floating leaves people would have gotten it.  It wouldn''t have been as nice a picture in original orientation, but it would have helped people figure it out.</td>', 'I sympathize with you.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but if I had seen this I would have thought it was right-side up with a lawn on bottom, shaded wall and building even after looking at it for a while.  It was just too perfect with no leaves or ripples in the water.  Of course it''s really obvious when you see the original unrotated image.  If we had seen some more orientation detail "below" the lawn or if there were some floating leaves people would have gotten it.  It wouldn''t have been as nice a picture in original orientation, but it would have helped people figure it out.', '2009-01-01 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
